== Icelandic ==
===Etymology===
From ''[[kynna]]'' meaning "to [[introduce]]" and ''[[sig#Icelandic|sig]]'' meaning "[[oneself]]".
=== Verb ===

'''kynna sig'''

# to [[introduce]] [[oneself]]
#: '''''Kynntu þig''' drengur!''
#:: '''Introduce yourself''' boy!

